Chapter: Atomic

 Atomic type definitions for GPU kernels. Scope is encoded in the
 type: DeviceAtomic is visible across the entire device, BlockAtomic
 within a thread block, SystemAtomic across CPU and GPU. Ordering
 is a value argument.

 We say:

Section: Types

  MemOrdering =
    | Relaxed
    | Acquire
    | Release
    | AcqRel
    | SeqCst

  DeviceAtomic = record {
    da-addr : Integer
  }

  BlockAtomic = record {
    ba-addr : Integer
  }

  SystemAtomic = record {
    sya-addr : Integer
  }

